msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Sparky Stereo OS is built on SparkyLinux, by Paweł “pavroo” Pijanowski. "
"Everything SparkyLinux's own welcome window offers is here, and that window "
"stays in the menu as Welcome."
msgstr ""

